  "optimizations_kept": [
    "Inline R61524::TickFrameMark (eliminates 2x out-of-line call + 2x 64-bit modulo % 550000 per SH7305 instruction)",
    "Namespace-scoped cached diagnostic flags (eliminates MSVC function-local static TLS guards on Read/Write/Step)",
    "Direct SDRAM/SystemROM/ILRAM fast-paths in Read8/16/32 and Write8/16/32 (guarded by #ifndef CG50_ENABLE_COVERAGE_COUNTERS)",
    "TickRtc() next-boundary comparison (eliminates 64-bit % 32000 per instruction)",
    "HasAnyPendingInterrupt() + Intc2Unit::AnyPending() + Scif0Unit::HasPendingIrq() fast-out",
    "EtmuUnit/tmu0/tpu/BSC/RTC/FlashCFI idle guards in TickTimerUnit()",
    "Cold noinline extraction of HandleAppIfTrap, LogStepDiagnostics and HaltFetchOutOfMap out of StepInstruction() (eliminates wstringstream EH frame & GS stack cookie on hot loop)"
  ],
  "empirical_lesson_documented": "An intermediate experiment inlining RAM/ROM fast-paths into all 6 ExecuteOpcode lambdas caused L1i cache bloat (32 KB I-cache thrash: 15.2 -> 11.6 MIPS 1T) and was reverted after empirical measurement.",
